        }
      ],
      "text": "@GoogleDeepMind @signalapp The expensive part of enterprise software was never writing it. It's proving it does what it claims: audits, pen tests, compliance reviews. If proof gets cheap, the bottleneck in shipping AI-written code moves from verification to deciding what to build.",
      "url": "https://x.com/Mike_Maresca/status/2120641592591843494"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2078707395438759936",
      "created_at": "2026-11-11T22:08:01.000Z",
