          "reply_count": 278,
          "retweet_count": 191
        },
        "text": "For the first time, AI has mathematically proven @signalapp’s protocol is secure down to the code level.\n\nUsing our breakthrough AlphaProof Code framework, we verified the messaging app’s cryptographic system – which protects billions of private messages every day. https://t.co/iWNJ8UiTSQ"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "4783690002",
        "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:50:16.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2120484249321033911"
        ],
        "id": "2120484249321033911",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "4783690002",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 19,
          "impression_count": 20003,
          "like_count": 124,
          "quote_count": 8,
          "reply_count": 19,
          "retweet_count": 5
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2120484246401777737",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Gemini agents generated over 6M lines of proofs in Lean, auditing the code so human experts only had to review the critical 1%.\n\nThis is a key step toward using AI to verify vital infrastructure we all rely on – from daily communication to power grids. Find out more →"
      }
